REPAIR
======

Copyright (c) 2026 Mohammad Khoshnazar, Mohammad Dehghani Tezerjani,
Qing Yang, and Michael Beetz.

REPAIR integrates with and adapts interfaces from OpenVLA-OFT, originally
copyright (c) 2025 Moo Jin Kim, Chelsea Finn, and Percy Liang and distributed
under the MIT License. OpenVLA-OFT is available at:
https://github.com/moojink/openvla-oft

The runtime also depends on separately distributed projects including LIBERO,
robosuite, MuJoCo, and PyTorch. Their own licenses and citation requirements
apply to those components. No upstream model weights or datasets are included
in this repository.
